### Crear aviso de mantenimiento por horómetro (noticeId null = crear) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByHourmeter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com;supervisor@ejemplo.com",
  "maintenanceLineId": 1,
  "maintenanceRangeId": 1,
  "interval": 250,
  "nextEvent": 1250,
  "message": "Servicio de motor cada 250 horas",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Actualizar aviso existente (noticeId con valor) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByHourmeter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": 1,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "maintenanceLineId": 1,
  "maintenanceRangeId": 1,
  "interval": 300,
  "nextEvent": 1500,
  "message": "Servicio de motor cada 300 horas (actualizado)",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByHourmeter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "interval": 250,
  "nextEvent": 1250,
  "message": "Servicio de motor",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Validación: unitId con tipo inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByHourmeter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": "no-numerico",
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "interval": 250,
  "nextEvent": 1250,
  "message": "Servicio de motor",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Unidad inexistente (RAISERROR del SP) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByHourmeter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 999999999,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "maintenanceLineId": 1,
  "maintenanceRangeId": 1,
  "interval": 250,
  "nextEvent": 1250,
  "message": "Servicio de motor",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}
